00:58:39.030 --> 00:58:40.960
<v Jack Hitt>I went, and I prayed.
<v Jack Hitt>我去祈祷了，我决定——

00:58:40.960 --> 00:58:57.350
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着《美国生活》的更多故事回来。

00:58:57.350 --> 00:59:02.350
